# Keep the container-image build context minimal and deterministic.
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . ${LAMBDA_TASK_ROOT}/interceptor/`, so exclude
# anything that is not interceptor Python source: the Dockerfile itself, this
# ignore file, and Python bytecode caches (which would otherwise bloat the
# image layer and perturb the asset hash across machines).
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
